SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Thirty-four days before she’s sent to prison\, notorious Sili
 con Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to docum
 ent her every move. What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic fe
 lon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into the abyss. From boundar
 y-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenheim comes You Can See E
 verything.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/you-can-see-everything\
 nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/you-can-see-everything
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6da42ffaa729c645fb4960d9e524270fa9e6941b@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261115T000000Z
DTEND:20261115T020000Z
SUMMARY:Wildwood
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Wildwood is a handcrafted epic fantasy that transports audience
 s into a secret\, dangerously alive world. A girl’s desperate quest to s
 ave her baby brother unfolds into a spectacular\, high-stakes adventure th
 rough a forbidden forest full of enchanted creatures\, endearing allies\, 
 and formidable adversaries—where an entire hidden realm hangs in the bal
 ance. In an era of automation\, LAIKA delivers its most ambitious and glob
 ally accessible film yet—a bold fusion of human-crafted artistry and cin
 ematic storytelling from the makers of Coraline.\nhttps://www.westnewtonci
 nema.com/movie/wildwood\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/wildwood
END:VEVENT
